AgentDojo
---------

Project:  https://github.com/ethz-spylab/agentdojo
Version:  v1.2.2
Citation: Debenedetti et al., "AgentDojo: A Dynamic Environment to Evaluate Prompt Injection
          Attacks and Defenses for LLM Agents", NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks.
License:  MIT (reproduced below)

Derived material in this repository:

- benches/agentdojo-injection.jsonl: tool-result texts, injection payloads and attack
  templates taken from AgentDojo's task suites, harvested by benchmarks/agentdojo/extract.py.
- docs/results/2026-09-24-agentdojo*/: results of runs over AgentDojo's task suites, which
  quote task and tool-result text from those suites.

The scripts under benchmarks/agentdojo/ are original work (Apache-2.0) that import AgentDojo
at run time; AgentDojo itself is not redistributed.

